[21:48:56] [PROCESS] Methodology: kappa_Cep is imported from TEP-H0 (Paper 11) as the redshift-only WLS value (0.452 +/- 0.220) x 10^6 mag (sigma_v = 150 km/s), loaded from the TEP-H0 companion results. The anchor reference potential U_ref = (87.165 km/s)^2 and the screened potential coordinate X_i = (U_i - U_ref) / c^2 are defined per the TEP framework. No (1+z)^{-0.3} redshift factor is applied to avoid circularity with the Section 7 H0(z) prediction.
